            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "A股收跌深股全日低位收市   一周計跌近6.5%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A股收跌，深股跌3%以全日低位收市，一周計跌近6.5%，創業板指數跌逾3.5%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"A股 AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/05/20250407_FI_source-ap_AShare-3.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"A股 AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/05/20250407_FI_source-ap_AShare-3.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">A股 AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬綜指收跌43點或1.22%，報3,533，上午低報3,500，跌77點或2.15%，午後一度突破上午高位3,527，見3,538，跌39點或1.09%，為全日高位，成交7,025.74億元(人民幣‧下同)。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">深成指全日收報10,256，跌326點或3.09%，以全日低位收市，上午見高位10,436，跌147點或1.38%，全日成交7196.27億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">創業板指數跌81點或3.54%，報2212點，滬深300跌30點或0.76%，報3,954。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬股一周累跌101點或2.77%，深股一周累跌712點或6.49%。</p>\n</div>",
